{"nodes": [{"id": "screenshots_llm", "label": "LLM Settings Screen (ARTEX Console)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A full-page settings screen in the ARTEX agent console for configuring the LLM profiles shared by all Agents: provider format, model id, endpoint, egress proxy, API key, rate limits, context window and extended-thinking behavior. Two-column pattern: profile list on the left, edit form on the right; the active profile is starred and the form header states that saving an active profile applies immediately to every Agent."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_sidebar_nav", "label": "ARTEX Console Sidebar Navigation", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_profiles_panel", "label": "Profiles List Panel", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_claude_opus_profile", "label": "Claude Opus 4.8 Profile Card (Active)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Highlighted with a filled star and an amber-tinted border because it is the active profile; shows provider badge ANTHROPIC, model id claude-opus-4-8, masked key suffix ...a3f2, per-second/per-minute limits 0/s and 0/min, a reasoning-effort badge (\u601d\u8003 high), and a disabled-looking '\u5df2\u6fc0\u6d3b' button plus a delete icon."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_deepseek_v4_profile", "label": "DeepSeek V4 Profile Card (Inactive)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Inactive profile card: outline star, white background, OPENAI provider badge, model deepseek-v4-flash, key suffix ...9c11, limits 0/s and 60/min, and an enabled '\u8bbe\u4e3a\u6fc0\u6d3b' (set active) button, showing that exactly one profile is globally active at a time."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_edit_profile_form", "label": "Edit Profile Form", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Edits the selected profile (header '\u7f16\u8f91 Profile\uff1aClaude Opus 4.8' with an active badge). Helper text states changes take effect on save and, for the active profile, immediately across all Agents. Fields are grouped: identity/format, endpoint, proxy, credential, throttle, context, then reasoning options."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_format_selector", "label": "Provider Format Selector", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Format is an enum-style dropdown (Anthropic shown) that selects the request/response wire format independently of the model id, so OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic-native endpoints can both be configured."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_model_field", "label": "Model ID Field", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_base_url_field", "label": "Base URL Field (Optional)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_proxy_field", "label": "Egress Proxy Field (Optional)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Accepts http/https/socks5 proxy URLs (placeholder shows an HTTP and a SOCKS5 example). Scoped only to LLM outbound requests; when blank the standard HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY environment variables are used, keeping container-level proxy configuration as the default."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_api_key_field", "label": "API Key Field (Masked)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Secrets are never echoed back: the field shows '\u5df2\u8bbe\u7f6e\uff08...a3f2\uff09' (already set, last four chars only) and leaving it blank preserves the stored key, so editing other settings cannot accidentally clear the credential."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_rate_limits", "label": "Per-Second and Per-Minute Rate Limits", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two numeric fields (requests per second, requests per minute) with 0 meaning unlimited; because profiles are global, the limits are shared by every Agent rather than configured per Agent."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_context_window", "label": "Context Window Field (K tokens)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_extended_thinking", "label": "Extended Thinking Mode Toggle", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three-state thinking control: omit the thinking field entirely (default, for models such as MiniMax that reject it), explicitly send disabled (only needed for models that think by default), or enable reasoning-before-answer (shown as \u5f00\u542f). This tri-state exists purely for cross-provider compatibility rather than for user preference."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_reasoning_effort", "label": "Reasoning Effort Control", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Partially visible below Extended Thinking; the active profile card surfaces the chosen level as a '\u601d\u8003 high' badge, so effort is a per-profile property that affects all Agents using it."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_shared_profile_activation", "label": "Global Profile Activation Shared by All Agents", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Subtitle '\u5168 Agent \u5171\u4eab\u7684\u683c\u5f0f / \u6a21\u578b / \u9650\u901f\u914d\u7f6e' plus 'All Agents share one active Profile, rate limits are global' establish the core design decision: model, wire format and throttling are configured once at profile level and applied to every Agent, instead of each Agent carrying its own LLM settings. The single-active-profile rule is conveyed by one filled star and a 'set active' action on the others."}, {"id": "screenshots_llm_context_compression_threshold", "label": "Context Compression Threshold", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The configured context window is used as the compaction trigger, not merely as an API parameter: 0/blank defaults to 200K, the cap is 1000K (1M), and setting it too high prevents compression from ever firing. This couples a UI number to runtime history-truncation behavior."}], "edges": [{"source": "screenshots_llm", "target": "screenshots_llm_sidebar_nav", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_llm", "target": "screenshots_llm_profiles_panel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_llm", "target": "screenshots_llm_edit_profile_form", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_llm_profiles_panel", "target": "screenshots_llm_claude_opus_profile", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_llm_profiles_panel", "target": "screenshots_llm_deepseek_v4_profile", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_llm_edit_profile_form", "target": "screenshots_llm_format_selector", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_llm_edit_profile_form", "target": "screenshots_llm_model_field", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_llm_edit_profile_form", "target": "screenshots_llm_base_url_field", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/llm.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_llm_edit_profile_form", "target": "screenshots_llm_proxy_field", "relation": "references", "con